  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting social inclusion and gender equality for the empowerment of Marginalized Gafat Beta Israel Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to address the intersectional marginalization of women and girls in the Gafat Beta Israel (GBI) community in Lemo Woreda through an integrated, gender-responsive, and rights-based approach. The project will focus on reinforcing pillars: social inclusion and empowerment, education and protection, economic resilience, and inclusive governance.&#xa0;
Specific:
To increase the average income of 180 GBI women engaged in Self Help Groups (SHG)
To improve educational participation of 300 GBI and economically poor children through life skill trainings&#xa0;
To improve access to safe, friendly and survivor-centered health and protection service for GBI women and girls</narrative>
  </description>
